  "guidance": "Take multiple columns and merge them to a list.\n\n## Migrated examples\n#### Merging Multiple Columns to a Single List\n\n##### Recipe\n\n```yaml\nwrangles:\n  - merge.to_list:\n      input:\n        - Col1\n        - Col2\n        - Col3\n      output: List Col\n```\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-grid\">\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Input Sample\n\n| Col1 | Col2 | Col3 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| A | B | C |\n\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Output Sample\n\n| List Col |\n| --- |\n| ['A', 'B', 'C'] |\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
